    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis spacious four-bedroom bungalow, set on an extensive 0.33 acre site, offers excellent family accommodation together with a large, private south-facing rear garden.\n\nIdeally located within walking distance of Daly's SuperValu Centre, Woodlands Industrial Estate and Killarney Sports & Leisure Centre, the property is approximately 1.75 km from Killarney town centre, combining convenient access to local amenities with the benefits of a generous residential site.\n\nThe accommodation extends over ground and attic levels. At ground floor level, the property comprises an entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, living room, bathroom and four bedrooms, two of which are en-suite. The attic level provides two additional en-suite bedrooms, offering excellent flexibility for family living, guest accommodation or home working.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a substantial rear garden with a south-facing aspect, a storage shed and a detached garage. There is also extensive off-street parking to the front.\n\nWith its generous site, flexible accommodation and convenient location close to Killarney town and a range of local amenities, this property offers considerable potential as a family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.20 x 1.73 + 5.8 x 1\n\n\nSitting room - 4.23 x 3.56\nStove\n\nDining room - 3.20 x 4.30\n\n\nSunroom (extension) - 2.25 x 2.78\n\n\nKitchen (extension) - 3.50 x 2.22\n\n\nKitchen - 3.00 x 3.76\n\n\nBathroom - 2.00 x 1.98\n\n\nBedroom One - 4.20 x 3.65\nIncludes en-suite with shower, wc, wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.00 x 2.60\n\n\nBedroom Three - 4.10 x 3.60\nIncludes en-suite with shower, wc, wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom Four - 4.23 x 2.72\n\n\nDetached garage - \n\n\nArea: House 115 sq.m. - \n\n\nAttic 46 sq.m. - \n\n\nTotal: 160 sq.m., (1,722 sq.ft.) - \n\n\n"
      },
